\par
\textbf{of the analysis. For the least experienced users, the order in}
\par
\textbf{which the decision aids are employed may be determined automatically}
\par
\textbf{on the basis of the user's problem structure. However, -acre so-}
\par
\textbf{phisticated users will undoubtedly want a kit from which they can}
\par
\textbf{select or construct the most appropriate tool at each stage of the}
\par
\textbf{analysis. The purpose of this section is to deserve conceptual tools}
\par
\textbf{that will form the basis of an integrated set of automated decision aids.}
