\emph{Directional Nature of Operatore}
\par
\textbf{By definition, operators have a direction; they transform}
\par
\textbf{inputs into outputs, but not vice versa. Thus, we can view opera-}
\par
\textbf{tors as a mapping from one entity space to another. One Implica-}
\par
\textbf{tion of this definltioh Is that an equation is not an operator}
